{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene features a shirt positioned on the left side, with a laptop placed above it; the shirt is visually larger than the laptop. For every donut in the image, there is a plate located below the donut, and a wrench located below that plate. Additionally, the plate is positioned below the shirt.",
